sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant R as FastAPI Routes
    participant P as Planner Agent
    participant S as Scheduler Engine
    participant RE as Resilience Scorer
    participant CH as Chaos Engine
    participant RP as Repair Agent

    Note over U,RP: PLAN FLOW
    U->>F: destination="India", dates, budget, interests
    F->>R: POST /api/plan {PlanRequest}
    R->>P: plan_activities(destination, dates, budget, interests)
    P->>P: Gemini 3.6 Flash (retry-once, JSON repair)
    P-->>R: {activities: [{id, name, location, time_window, cost, duration}]}
    R->>R: Convert to SchedActivity models
    R->>S: schedule_itinerary(activities, start_date, num_days)
    S->>S: Greedy nearest-neighbor + time-window pruning
    S->>S: Multi-day distribution with overflow
    S-->>R: Itinerary {days: [ItineraryDay], total_cost, total_travel}
    R->>RE: compute_resilience(itinerary)
    RE-->>R: ResilienceScore {overall, rating, factors[]}
    R-->>F: {destination, days[], resilience_score, total_cost}
    F->>F: Render timeline, charts, resilience badge

    Note over U,RP: CHAOS FLOW
    U->>F: Click "CHAOS MODE"
    F->>R: POST /api/chaos
    R->>CH: trigger_chaos(itinerary, candidate_pool)
    CH-->>R: Disruption {cancelled_activity_id, type}
    R->>RP: repair_itinerary(itinerary, disruption, candidate_pool)
    RP->>RP: find_alternative() in candidate pool
    RP->>RP: Compute diff (removed/modified/shifted)
    RP-->>R: RepairResult {success, diff_entries[], explanation}
    R-->>F: {repair: {diff_entries[], explanation}}
    F->>F: Render diff panel with change highlighting

    Note over U,RP: CHAT FLOW
    U->>F: "What should I do tomorrow?"
    F->>R: POST /api/chat {message}
    R->>R: Build itinerary context string
    R->>R: Gemini 3.6 Flash (or keyword fallback)
    R-->>F: {response: "On Day 2..."}
    F->>F: Display in chat panel
